+# Plan: createPatch
+- Objects: remove missing keys, recurse into shared keys, add new keys.
+- Arrays: match equal items with an LCS over canonical keys; unmatched equal items are paired as moves (emitted as remove + add); remaining unmatched items in the same gap are paired positionally and diffed recursively; the rest are removes/adds. Removes go first (descending index), then a left-to-right walk adds items and recurses into in-place items, so every index is valid when emitted.
+- Reuse `clone`, `deepEqual`. Tests in `test/create-patch.test.ts`.
